{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2005-meet-science2-44","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"statistics","number":44,"points":null,"unitId":"statistics","unitLabel":"기초 생물통계학","topic":"기초 통계학","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["statistics"],"stem":"두치료제A와B의치료효과가다른지알아보기위해200명의\n환자를임의로100명씩두그룹으로나누어, 한그룹에는치료제A\n를투여하고다른그룹에는치료제B를투여한다음치료효과를\n조사하였다. <표>는치료효과를‘매우높음’, ‘약간높음’, ‘거의없음’\n의세범주로나누었을때각범주에속한환자의수를나타낸\n것이다.\n치료효과\n매우높음\n약간높음\n거의없음\n치료제\nA\n35\n25\n40\nB\n45\n35\n20\n이자료를사용하여치료제에따라치료효과의차이가있는지\n검정하기위해카이제곱(χ 2) 검정을한결과의일부는다음과\n같았다.\nPearson 카이제곱검정통계량\n자유도(df)\np-값(p-value)\n9.583\n(가)\n0.008\n이결과에의하면유의수준5%에서\n“치료제A와B에따라치료효과의차이가\n(나)\n.”\n고볼수있다. (가)와(나)에들어갈내용을바르게짝지은것은?\n(가)\n(나)","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030","t031","t032","t033","t034","t035"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"6 없다","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t036","t037","t038"]},{"number":2,"text":"6 있다","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t039","t040","t041"]},{"number":3,"text":"3 없다","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t042","t043","t044"]},{"number":4,"text":"2 없다","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t045","t046","t047"]},{"number":5,"text":"2 있다","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t048","t049","t050"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":765,"height":195,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,119.264,306.0,78.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2005-meet-science2-44/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":765,"height":103,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,268.464,306.0,41.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetde